319
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,433
[Lol]

320
00:10:37,433 --> 00:10:38,533
This will be impossible.

321
00:10:38,533 --> 00:10:39,866
You take a look too CHIQUITA.

322
00:10:39,866 --> 00:10:41,566
