426
00:15:29,633 --> 00:15:31,100
- I didn't realize my younger member cared about me this much.
- Younger member.

427
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:33,166
[Ha...] She said she'd call me RORA unni from today.

428
00:15:33,166 --> 00:15:35,100
[Love their playful bickering]

429
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,466
